      "writtenOn": "2022-09-14T19:54:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "We\u0027d been uploading a depth value to the uniform but we weren\u0027t putting it into `devPosition` so the actual GPU data used in the depth test wouldn\u0027t necessarily match what we were expecting. This could have lead to weird ordering artifacts when multiple drawVertices() calls overlapped, but my guess is we don\u0027t  have GMs that really test for that.",
